designer_notes = "THE FIRST CREATURE (Luke's H5, 2026-11-07; built 2026-11-09, HERBALISM_HUNTING_PREP.md §7 step 3): it grazes round its point and never fights. It sees you within notice_m (16 m, in sight), hears you within startle_m (5 m), and is startled by any hit: then it bolts flee_m (25 m) from you at a gallop a little faster than your sprint, never past leash_m from home; calm_ms (6 s) with nobody near, it walks back. Its poise never breaks (a hit never staggers it: it runs). Slain, it pays weapon mastery XP and leaves its CARCASS (skinning, 2026-11-09: content/node/deer_carcass.tres), skinned with a knife for its hide. Claude's numbers, Luke's to change."
